margin-top:0;\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-av_hr-e20845366ecf4191d9d28e96992d31d2 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-av_hr-e20845366ecf4191d9d28e96992d31d2 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-av_one_half-8cdbb378864195f7b9517e600bbf174b sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-av_one_half-8cdbb378864195f7b9517e600bbf174b av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mownuybe-71cc1eac520737c49a778290f0ef8269 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3155\">Nos complace anunciar que Venol participar\u00e1 en el Foro Empresarial Polaco-Egipcio que se celebrar\u00e1 el <strong>11 de mayo de 2026<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3514\">En el evento participar\u00e1n representantes de la Oficina Comercial Exterior de la Agencia Polaca de Inversiones y Comercio en El Cairo, del Departamento de \u00c1frica y Oriente Medio de la PAIH, de la Embajada de la Rep\u00fablica de Polonia en El Cairo, del Bank Gospodarstwa Krajowego, de la Agencia de Desarrollo Industrial, as\u00ed como empresas polacas seleccionadas.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3516\" data-end=\"3654\">Estamos orgullosos de formar parte de un evento tan importante que apoya el desarrollo de la cooperaci\u00f3n econ\u00f3mica entre Polonia y Egipto.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"3722\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Les invitamos a reunirse y conversar con nosotros durante el Foro.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-av_one_half-421c1bf5d4c122db8f22821bc87bc328 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-mownunjy-de04403c006a73f3fe983ae9558b5516\">\n.avia-image-container.av-mownunjy-de04403c006a73f3fe983ae9558b5516 img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-mownunjy-de04403c006a73f3fe983ae9558b5516 .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-mownunjy-de04403c006a73f3fe983ae9558b5516 av-styling- avia-align-center  avia-builder-el-5  avia-builder-el-no-sibling '   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image-5340 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-5340 avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/KAIR_EN-3-1030x1030.png\" alt='' title='KAIR_EN'  height=\"1030\" width=\"1030\"  itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" srcset=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/KAIR_EN-3-1030x1030.png 1030w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/KAIR_EN-3-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/KAIR_EN-3-80x80.png 80w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/KAIR_EN-3-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/KAIR_EN-3-1536x1536.png 1536w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/KAIR_EN-3-36x36.png 36w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/KAIR_EN-3-180x180.png 180w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/KAIR_EN-3-1500x1500.png 1500w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/KAIR_EN-3-705x705.png 705w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/KAIR_EN-3.png 20